  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">（注）１．取締役中庄谷博規氏、磯和春美氏、梶原祐理子氏、安岡正晃氏、谷明典氏は社外取締役であります。</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row2Member">
